        "print(\"\\n### Cluster 0: Frequent, Lower Impact Events\")\n",
        "print(\"- **Characteristics:** This is the largest cluster, representing the most frequent flood events. These events typically have lower water levels, fewer affected families, and less damage to both infrastructure and agriculture compared to the other clusters.\")\n",
