        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "The previous code failed because the 'Month_Num' column was not correctly recognized when creating the datetime column. I need to ensure the 'Month_Num' column is correctly included in the DataFrame used to create the datetime objects. I will also address the FutureWarning by using the non-inplace fillna method.\n",
